## Identity

{% if identity_prefix -%}
Records are keyed by {{ identity_prefix }} CURIEs where a term exists
{%- if identity_root %}, descending from `{{ identity_root }}`{% endif %}.
Where none exists, the record mints `{{ mech_slug }}:<slug>` and can be
re-grounded later.
{%- else -%}
Records mint `{{ mech_slug }}:<slug>` identifiers. No ontology keys them.
{%- endif %}

The filename stem is derived from `name`: lowercase, runs of non-alphanumerics
become one underscore.

